    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1033">

                <pb facs="0794" n="712" xml:id="pg712"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 892.001/81.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The King of Siam to the
                            President.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-12-02"><hi rendition="#italic">December 2,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Please accept my heartfelt thanks for the cordial felicitations and assurances of
                    friendship and good will on part of your Government and people, which I highly
                    value,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Vajiravudh.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
